        "before": "/interactData/paneLayoutOverride/windowtitle/title",
        "after": "/shortdescription",
        "count": 1
      },
      {
        "before": "/interactData/paneLayoutOverride/windowtitle/subtitle",
        "after": "/description",
        "count": 1
      },
      {
        "before": ",\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/chatOptions/0\",\n    \"value\": \"你要修还是买什么吗？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/chatOptions/1\",\n    \"value\": \"那些外勤人员总是能塞给我被使用的奇形怪状的道具。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/chatOptions/2\",\n    \"value\": \"这破代理机器人是哪个行会做的？这是山童的布线吗？\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/chatOptions/3\",\n    \"value\": \"不接受非外环区货币，我们又不会特地飞到那些人类的世界去消费。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/chatOptions/4\",\n    \"value\": \"董事会总是提醒我们创始人已经因为船难“牺牲”了，说让我们多向前看什么的。。。要我说，这又不是她第一次被我们河童认为“死亡”了，她现在肯定还在个什么地方搞着什么大计划。\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"op\": \"replace\",\n    \"path\": \"/chatOptions/5\",\n    \"value\": \"你问我们为啥喜欢吃黄瓜？那你说我们为什么需要呼吸呢？\"\n  }",
        "after": "",
        "count": 1
      }
    ],
    "kind": "patch",
    "target": "/objects/GICEXP/gicexp_nt_engi/gicexp_nt_engi.object",
    "reason": "Retain the merchant name and role translations on the live object tooltip. The old random chat/window operations belong to the retired merchant interface; the exact current ScriptPane exclusively runs the existing authored Chinese visual-novel scenes, which remain unchanged.",
    "guards": [
